WEBVTT

01:26.290 --> 01:31.560
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.210 --> 01:39.530
[Episode 15: Heart Devouring Poison]

01:41.020 --> 01:44.430
Greetings, Master. I'm disciple Mo Bufan.

02:00.680 --> 02:02.320
Mo Bufan.

02:02.440 --> 02:05.220
Do you think I can't see you?

02:05.870 --> 02:07.566
Master, your are extremely skillful.

02:07.590 --> 02:09.146
I admire you immensely.

02:09.170 --> 02:10.366
Do you know

02:10.390 --> 02:13.066
why I summoned you here alone?

02:13.090 --> 02:14.366
It's because of Yun Xiang?

02:14.390 --> 02:15.406
He declared

02:15.430 --> 02:17.956
to make the No.1 gambling house in Jiangnan.

02:17.980 --> 02:19.966
On this ridiculous matter,

02:19.990 --> 02:22.790
do you have any knowledge of the inside information?

02:23.520 --> 02:28.246
It began with Qi Tianfeng admitting that

02:28.270 --> 02:30.246
Tang Xiao assassinated Wen Cong.

02:30.270 --> 02:32.270
Since Yun Xiang has taken over

02:32.270 --> 02:33.346
the post of Nandu General Governor,

02:33.370 --> 02:36.146
of course he'd want to put an end to the bygones.

02:36.170 --> 02:38.456
This is also for the sake of irritating Tang Xiao

02:38.480 --> 02:40.240
so that he would bite the hook himself.

02:44.600 --> 02:46.546
As long as he defeats Tang Xiao,

02:46.570 --> 02:49.006
he could take the throne in gambling

02:49.030 --> 02:51.726
and control the most profitable business in the world.

02:51.750 --> 02:52.710
He's also doing it

02:52.710 --> 02:55.226
for the long-term benefit of our sect.

02:55.250 --> 02:58.770
I was worried that the sect was not big enough for the two of you.

02:58.870 --> 03:01.760
I didn't expect that you two were birds of a feather.

03:03.420 --> 03:04.870
Don't worry, Master.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.886
No cliques can be formed in one sect.

03:06.910 --> 03:08.816
I've always kept that in mind.

03:08.840 --> 03:12.350
I know what I'm doing with Yun Xiang.

03:13.020 --> 03:14.500
Mo Bufan.

03:14.710 --> 03:17.660
I will leave Nandu soon.

03:17.790 --> 03:21.536
From now on, you must report

03:21.560 --> 03:24.086
every move of Yun Xiang to me.

03:24.110 --> 03:26.730
I'll definitely keep you updated on everything I know.

03:32.580 --> 03:35.820
[Liansheng House]

03:36.310 --> 03:37.230
It's a little dirty over there.

03:37.230 --> 03:38.126
Wipe that.

03:37.600 --> 03:40.020
[Liansheng House]

03:38.150 --> 03:39.600
Okay.

03:40.850 --> 03:42.350
Come on. This way.

03:44.990 --> 03:46.440
Be careful.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.806
Give it to me.

03:54.830 --> 03:55.526
Hands are needed here.

03:55.550 --> 03:57.000
Pass it to me please.

04:07.130 --> 04:09.276
Add three more vents in the kitchen.

04:09.300 --> 04:10.870
Use hollow bricks.

04:10.980 --> 04:11.756
Remember,

04:11.780 --> 04:14.286
don't let any cooking smell in the front hall.

04:14.310 --> 04:15.486
No problem.

04:15.510 --> 04:17.306
But the schedule is a bit tight.

04:17.330 --> 04:18.110
Master, do you think we can...

04:18.110 --> 04:19.205
No.

04:19.229 --> 04:20.966
The deadline and salary have been settled.

04:20.990 --> 04:23.030
Don't think of raising the price now.

04:23.140 --> 04:24.900
I know you all work hard.

04:25.310 --> 04:28.256
If you finish it on time and pass the test,

04:28.280 --> 04:29.730
we'll talk about the reward then.

04:29.940 --> 04:32.010
Thanks a lot.

04:40.549 --> 04:41.999
Master.

04:43.030 --> 04:44.480
Mr. Su.

04:45.020 --> 04:46.546
Such an overhaul.

04:46.570 --> 04:48.360
It must be Yun's idea.

04:49.430 --> 04:51.540
Mr. Yun wants to make Liansheng House

04:51.540 --> 04:53.730
the No.1 gambling house in Jiangnan.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.796
Since you are so busy,

04:55.820 --> 04:58.050
you don't have time to chat with me, do you?

05:02.230 --> 05:04.190
The color is dyed so well.

05:04.820 --> 05:06.270
I'll make the embroidery for you

05:06.420 --> 05:08.270
when I have time.

05:15.230 --> 05:16.680
No hurry.

05:19.310 --> 05:20.760
Wait for me.

05:27.740 --> 05:28.566
Jin.

05:28.590 --> 05:29.580
Get off my back. Don't follow me.

05:29.580 --> 05:30.566
Listen to me, Jin.

05:30.590 --> 05:32.076
It's not that I don't want you to go.

05:32.100 --> 05:33.106
But maybe we can think of

05:33.130 --> 05:34.326
a better way.

05:34.350 --> 05:36.520
Drop it. I know you too well.

05:40.590 --> 05:42.040
Who knows what you're up to,

05:42.230 --> 05:44.210
saying things like this.

05:44.540 --> 05:45.846
You're probably only afraid that

05:45.870 --> 05:47.560
you'll have no one to boss around without me here.

05:48.310 --> 05:50.336
It's so hard to make real connections with you.

05:50.360 --> 05:52.240
Yun. Jin.

05:58.860 --> 06:01.410
What are you fighting over?

06:01.470 --> 06:03.040
Mr. Liu of Zhaixing House

06:03.510 --> 06:05.566
bought a kid.

06:05.590 --> 06:07.126
And he wouldn't let us redeem him.

06:07.150 --> 06:09.446
Now he's sent the kid to the ancestral house in Yin County.

06:09.470 --> 06:10.670
He wants to take his sword there

06:10.670 --> 06:12.380
and get the kid back by force.

06:12.660 --> 06:14.406
Stop turning things upside down.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.350
I said I could reason with them first.

06:16.730 --> 06:17.616
If it doesn't work, then we take him by force.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.600
So by force it is.

06:21.550 --> 06:23.746
Most musicians in Nandu are from Zhaixing House.

06:23.770 --> 06:24.886
If you offend them,

06:24.910 --> 06:26.230
there will be no music

06:26.230 --> 06:27.286
in our teahouse.

06:27.310 --> 06:28.950
Shall we ask the waiters to entertain customers?

06:30.100 --> 06:32.886
After all, you're all about business.

06:32.910 --> 06:33.670
I just want to think of

06:33.670 --> 06:34.670
a perfect solution.

06:34.670 --> 06:35.886
But you got angry.

06:35.910 --> 06:36.230
I...

06:36.230 --> 06:37.680
Jin.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.290
Here.

06:40.700 --> 06:42.170
Take this.

06:42.910 --> 06:44.316
Give it to the Liu family's steward.

06:44.340 --> 06:47.370
I'm sure they'll do the Su family this favor.

06:52.049 --> 06:53.006
This is all it takes?

06:53.030 --> 06:54.246
Of course,

06:54.270 --> 06:56.116
Jin, don't forget the proper manner.

06:56.140 --> 06:58.506
Don't miss a penny of the ransom.

06:58.530 --> 07:01.270
After all, the Liu family is a senior member of the Chamber of Commerce.

07:01.470 --> 07:04.010
No problem. I'll buy you a drink when I'm back.

07:10.790 --> 07:13.680
Yun, you've always been good at dealing with him.

07:13.740 --> 07:15.580
Why do you seem a bit sweaty today?

07:17.280 --> 07:19.990
I kept a promise. I still need to get used to it.

07:23.140 --> 07:24.846
Do you have time, Yun?

07:24.870 --> 07:28.190
Let's go somewhere quiet and have a chat.

07:33.740 --> 07:36.880
Mr. Su, you said you wanted to chat.

07:37.380 --> 07:39.270
But we both know that

07:39.830 --> 07:41.700
the topic we'll be talking about

07:42.370 --> 07:44.120
is going to be a bit awkward.

07:46.570 --> 07:48.310
But if you have anything to say,

07:48.350 --> 07:50.040
just go ahead.

07:51.470 --> 07:53.136
I’ve figured out

07:53.160 --> 07:55.800
the ins and outs of the raw silk battle.

07:57.260 --> 07:58.836
If I say I had no feelings about it,

07:58.860 --> 08:00.550
that would be a lie.

08:02.300 --> 08:06.120
After all, I've always trusted you, Yun.

08:07.770 --> 08:09.266
But now,

08:09.290 --> 08:11.610
I've figured out one thing.

08:11.900 --> 08:13.550
If you were an enemy and

08:13.810 --> 08:15.980
never treated me as your friend,

08:16.220 --> 08:19.160
the Su family must have been destroyed.

08:20.220 --> 08:24.070
Actually, my sister asked me to get close to you

08:24.200 --> 08:25.650
and be sincere.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.560
If we can become good friends,

08:27.810 --> 08:31.090
I'm sure you can keep the Su family safe.

08:32.750 --> 08:35.030
You are really sincere, I would say.

08:36.559 --> 08:39.136
I know with my wisdom and experience,

08:39.160 --> 08:40.405
if I have ulterior motives,

08:40.429 --> 08:42.006
I can't hide it from you.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.415
It's better to be frank.

08:43.439 --> 08:46.360
This way, maybe we can get rid of our grudges.

08:47.350 --> 08:51.280
It's not a bad idea to be sincere.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.870
Can you take me as your disciple?

09:02.340 --> 09:03.790
All right.

09:04.590 --> 09:06.410
Please take me as your disciple, Yun.

09:10.130 --> 09:11.580
My hands are tied due to sect rules.

09:12.240 --> 09:13.940
It's impossible.

09:23.050 --> 09:24.500
However,

09:24.800 --> 09:27.290
you and I are both owners of Liansheng House.

09:27.620 --> 09:31.030
We must act in consert in the future.

09:31.380 --> 09:32.986
I can see that you are talented

09:33.010 --> 09:34.460
and smart.

09:35.060 --> 09:38.820
We don't have to be restricted to the status of master and disciple.

09:41.230 --> 09:42.680
Yes.

10:03.710 --> 10:05.160
In that case,

10:05.870 --> 10:07.350
do you know why I wanted to

10:07.350 --> 10:09.200
renovate Liansheng House at such a high price?

10:14.050 --> 10:15.500
Actually, I don't understand.

10:17.670 --> 10:19.370
Now that the Cao Sect has been destroyed,

10:19.970 --> 10:23.180
the next one is Tang Xiao.

10:26.710 --> 10:28.160
In seven days,

10:28.750 --> 10:31.206
I'd like to be the head of Nandu's gambling industry.

10:31.230 --> 10:33.030
Meanwhile, I hope that Tang Xiao

10:33.130 --> 10:37.350
will never have a place to stand in the city of Nandu.

10:45.370 --> 10:48.460
[Inner Chamber, Tang's Residence]

10:56.620 --> 10:58.206
How many days has she been here?

10:58.230 --> 10:59.046
My lord,

10:59.070 --> 11:01.166
counting in the day when we carried her off from the wedding,

11:01.190 --> 11:02.940
it's the fifth day today.

11:04.530 --> 11:07.220
You tried to run away three times in five days.

11:08.110 --> 11:09.840
Unblessed.

11:10.410 --> 11:12.830
Such a good life in front of her, but she doesn't want it.

11:20.230 --> 11:22.310
Wash her body

11:22.820 --> 11:24.820
and get her changed into the clothes she wore here.

11:25.180 --> 11:26.536
Yes.

11:26.560 --> 11:28.600
Come on. Take her away.

11:33.220 --> 11:35.586
Is this the one who ran away and got caught three times in three days

11:35.610 --> 11:37.370
and hung herself after she got back?

11:38.790 --> 11:39.646
My lord.

11:39.670 --> 11:41.940
You simply like other men's women.

11:42.860 --> 11:45.540
Well, I really do.

11:46.720 --> 11:47.646
My lord.

11:47.670 --> 11:49.016
The spy reported that

11:49.040 --> 11:51.720
Yun Xiang's next target is you.

11:51.820 --> 11:54.890
He wants to be the head of gambling in Nandu.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.576
How about I get rid of Yun Xiang?

11:58.600 --> 12:00.590
I'm warning you. Don't try him.

12:01.360 --> 12:04.230
Follow the plan and decrease his power first.

12:04.380 --> 12:05.456
Also,

12:05.480 --> 12:06.896
is Qi Tianfeng dead yet?

12:06.920 --> 12:09.406
All his men are dead.

12:09.430 --> 12:11.526
Who did that? We had the same plan.

12:11.550 --> 12:13.926
But he himself is nowhere to be found.

12:13.950 --> 12:16.300
Why does he have so many enemies?

12:17.830 --> 12:19.736
Today's reeves shad is very fresh.

12:19.760 --> 12:22.290
Here, have some more.

12:23.990 --> 12:25.440
Sister.

12:26.020 --> 12:29.150
I think Tang Xiao

12:29.380 --> 12:31.640
might become the next Qi Tianfeng.

12:33.070 --> 12:36.240
Tang Xiao has really been insolent and conceited these years.

12:36.920 --> 12:39.020
He's been ignoring the rules of the Chamber of Commerce.

12:39.350 --> 12:41.376
If someone could break his spirit,

12:41.400 --> 12:44.690
it's a good thing for the Nandu Chamber of Commerce as well.

12:45.330 --> 12:47.170
You don't have to say that, Sister.

12:48.390 --> 12:50.120
Right now, Tang Xiao

12:50.390 --> 12:52.210
is not our only trouble.

12:52.590 --> 12:54.850
Yun Xiang is still the one who worries me the most.

13:03.620 --> 13:05.576
The Tang family gives you six taels per month.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.910
How about I give you eight taels?

13:08.950 --> 13:10.606
Eight taels is a lot.

13:10.630 --> 13:13.760
But I can't do Liansheng House's work.

13:14.630 --> 13:16.330
Tell me the truth.

13:17.020 --> 13:17.936
Why is that?

13:17.960 --> 13:19.956
Tang Xiao told us before that

13:19.980 --> 13:23.460
if anyone from the Tangs' Gambling House dares to work for Liansheng House,

13:23.750 --> 13:27.070
he/she will be dead before their salary can be spent.

13:30.800 --> 13:33.046
In my early years in Liansheng House,

13:33.070 --> 13:34.726
you've taken good care of me, Miss Ke.

13:34.750 --> 13:37.120
I'm really sorry.

13:41.110 --> 13:44.200
I understand. I won't make things difficult for you.

13:44.410 --> 13:45.860
Please leave.

13:48.230 --> 13:49.680
Miss Ke, take care.

13:51.430 --> 13:52.346
Miss.

13:52.370 --> 13:54.806
If you ask me, they are all traitors.

13:54.830 --> 13:56.610
Why do you want to give them a raise instead?

13:56.830 --> 13:58.410
There are only few gambling houses in Nandu

13:58.430 --> 14:00.080
that are not under Tang Xiao's name.

14:00.390 --> 14:02.310
They have no other choices.

14:04.710 --> 14:06.400
How are things going with you?

14:06.500 --> 14:08.196
The waiters and pages are easy to find.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.740
They are almost fully recruited.

14:10.350 --> 14:12.196
Go on. Don't slack off.

14:12.220 --> 14:13.880
Come help me when you're done.

14:14.110 --> 14:15.630
Got it.

14:32.910 --> 14:34.810
Little boy, come here.

14:35.350 --> 14:37.270
Be careful, little boy.

14:37.690 --> 14:39.416
Uncle, help us please.

14:39.440 --> 14:40.710
My sister is almost beaten to death.

14:40.710 --> 14:42.586
Where is she? Take me there.

14:42.610 --> 14:44.060
Over there.

14:47.900 --> 14:50.190
Hurry up.

14:53.070 --> 14:54.600
She's right inside.

15:11.950 --> 15:13.400
Stop!

15:33.090 --> 15:34.650
What a coincidence.

15:35.350 --> 15:36.860
We meet again.

15:37.530 --> 15:40.440
You two really put in a lot of effort into this despicable scheme

15:40.580 --> 15:42.850
to get me here.

15:43.950 --> 15:46.030
I've been wanting to practice my swordsmanship with you.

15:46.700 --> 15:48.500
No time is better than today.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.680
Great.

16:18.970 --> 16:21.300
You are a master.

16:22.450 --> 16:23.900
But only a half.

16:24.370 --> 16:25.850
You want to die?

16:31.870 --> 16:33.320
Let me.

16:47.240 --> 16:49.790
Despicable you. Play the dirty tricks.

16:49.830 --> 16:52.230
Still, you can't beat your senior Jin.

17:19.910 --> 17:20.806
Miss.

17:20.830 --> 17:22.376
Master saw how hard you've been working,

17:22.400 --> 17:24.676
so he asked me to bring you a pot of jasmine tea.

17:24.700 --> 17:26.536
Thank you. Please thank Master for me.

17:26.560 --> 17:28.050
Next. Come in.

17:31.830 --> 17:33.750
Miss, please.

17:55.220 --> 17:56.960
This is not lime powder.

18:21.390 --> 18:23.470
How much poison did she take?

18:24.050 --> 18:26.100
Young Master, she took it all.

18:45.410 --> 18:47.180
Take a closer look.

18:47.250 --> 18:49.940
Who am I?

18:54.560 --> 18:56.470
You are my master.

18:57.950 --> 19:00.510
Your Heart Devouring Powder is really magical.

19:01.980 --> 19:05.606
It's worth it. So many beauties died for it.

19:05.630 --> 19:07.080
This poison

19:07.570 --> 19:08.946
has finally succeeded.

19:08.970 --> 19:10.596
Am I right, Tianhu?

19:10.620 --> 19:12.206
With the Heart Devouring Powder,

19:12.230 --> 19:14.596
you don’t need to worry if Miss Ke doesn't obey.

19:14.620 --> 19:16.366
That's the woman I love.

19:16.390 --> 19:18.286
Watch your mouth.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.746
Besides,

19:19.770 --> 19:22.010
the poison's effect is still unstable.

19:22.440 --> 19:25.160
Who's going to pay for it if I poison her to death?

19:25.550 --> 19:27.660
Ke Menglan, that bitch.

19:27.860 --> 19:31.380
I'll make her submit to me with her whole body and heart sooner or later.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.946
There'll be no need for poison.

19:32.970 --> 19:34.420
Come on.

19:35.270 --> 19:36.366
Tianhu.

19:36.390 --> 19:38.780
Do you know

19:39.750 --> 19:42.030
who the "bitch" I was talking about is?

19:42.910 --> 19:44.390
It's my sister.

19:45.190 --> 19:46.910
Is your sister

19:47.020 --> 19:48.590
a bitch?

19:49.410 --> 19:52.450
If Master says so, no doubt she is.

19:52.860 --> 19:54.310
Is everyone here?

19:55.270 --> 19:56.586
Sorry to keep you waiting.

19:56.610 --> 19:57.946
Come with me.

19:57.970 --> 19:59.286
Aren't we going to see Mr. Ke?

19:59.310 --> 20:00.846
It's the same talking to me.

20:00.870 --> 20:02.320
Come with me.

20:19.670 --> 20:21.660
According to rough estimation,

20:22.070 --> 20:24.170
2,500 taels.

20:25.020 --> 20:26.550
It's really not enough.

20:40.120 --> 20:41.670
Why didn't you knock?

20:41.740 --> 20:43.660
You're getting more and more unruly.

20:47.380 --> 20:49.096
Long time no see.

20:49.120 --> 20:50.326
How many times have you missed me?

20:50.350 --> 20:52.230
Mr. Tang.

20:57.030 --> 20:58.406
What are you looking at?

20:58.430 --> 21:01.550
Do you prefer there's someone out there

21:01.600 --> 21:03.050
or not?

21:05.320 --> 21:06.836
In broad daylight,

21:06.860 --> 21:08.690
this is not the Tangs' Gambling House.

21:08.880 --> 21:10.530
Please behave yourself, Mr. Tang.

21:10.910 --> 21:13.296
You really don't know me.

21:13.320 --> 21:14.976
In my whole life,

21:15.000 --> 21:17.720
what I love the most is someone else's house,

21:18.060 --> 21:21.870
and someone else's woman.

21:24.320 --> 21:26.856
Forget it. I won't tease you today.

21:26.880 --> 21:28.330
I came here

21:28.870 --> 21:31.220
to discuss something serious with you.

21:32.290 --> 21:34.850
Here, let me show you something.

21:34.970 --> 21:36.770
Open it.

21:47.760 --> 21:50.240
[Elevation Certificate]

21:54.240 --> 21:57.406
It really took me a lot of effort

21:57.430 --> 21:59.326
to get your elevation certificate

21:59.350 --> 22:01.336
from the Music Office.

22:01.360 --> 22:04.326
Take this to any government office,

22:04.350 --> 22:07.530
and you'll be elevated out of lowly status.

22:09.910 --> 22:11.316
Beauty.

22:11.340 --> 22:13.190
You must be careful.

22:13.410 --> 22:15.640
This is the only copy.

22:16.150 --> 22:19.610
If there is any damage,

22:19.860 --> 22:23.240
there will be no turning back.

22:27.510 --> 22:29.780
Tell me.

22:30.970 --> 22:33.296
There are so many men in the world

22:33.320 --> 22:35.376
who admire you,

22:35.400 --> 22:38.846
saying they'd steal the moon and stars for you.

22:38.870 --> 22:40.836
How many of them can be like me,

22:40.860 --> 22:45.040
knowing what you really want?

22:54.110 --> 22:58.310
Why don't you tell me frankly, Mr. Tang?

23:00.660 --> 23:02.710
What do you want me to exchange it for?

23:04.050 --> 23:06.346
After the renovation,

23:06.370 --> 23:07.980
our Liansheng House is indeed more magnificent.

23:08.560 --> 23:09.906
It'll be more beautiful when the red lanterns are lit

23:09.930 --> 23:11.636
when it gets dark.

23:11.660 --> 23:13.110
Right.

23:20.390 --> 23:21.840
Tianhu.

23:23.630 --> 23:25.080
What's the matter, Miss?

23:25.380 --> 23:27.170
Are you a little tired?

23:27.510 --> 23:29.190
A little.

23:30.940 --> 23:33.550
I went to see you at the box between 3 p.m. and 5 p.m.

23:33.680 --> 23:35.130
Where did you go?

23:36.350 --> 23:37.686
You are tricking me again, Miss.

23:37.710 --> 23:39.400
I've been in the box the whole time.

23:53.730 --> 23:55.180
Miss.

23:56.790 --> 23:58.126
Xiaoyu.

23:58.150 --> 23:59.600
Where's Ling'er?

24:01.180 --> 24:03.620
She's sneaking food in the kitchen.

24:06.430 --> 24:09.630
If you tell on her, you are not a good friend.

24:13.350 --> 24:14.406
Be my spy

24:14.430 --> 24:17.270
and help me win the bet of Young Master Xiang.

24:18.250 --> 24:20.166
Mr. Yun never set a bet.

24:20.190 --> 24:23.990
It's exactly Mr. Yun whose motive is exerable.

24:24.750 --> 24:27.566
He asked you to make Liansheng House

24:27.590 --> 24:31.150
better than the Tangs' Gambling House in every aspect.

24:33.430 --> 24:36.150
My life-or-death bet with him

24:36.860 --> 24:38.950
has started a long time ago.

25:05.700 --> 25:08.770
But she's the one who's not obedient.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.846
All right.

25:11.870 --> 25:14.030
Xiaoyu, Ling'er. You can eat anything you want

25:14.030 --> 25:15.746
in Liansheng House from now on.

25:15.770 --> 25:17.220
Okay?

25:17.530 --> 25:18.980
Are you hungry now?

25:19.630 --> 25:20.566
Go.

25:20.590 --> 25:23.360
Have some snacks with Tianhu in the kitchen.

25:23.990 --> 25:25.006
Watch them.

25:25.030 --> 25:26.480
Don't let them get burnt.

26:11.760 --> 26:13.210
Mr. Yun.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.946
You've worked hard, Manager Ke.

26:18.970 --> 26:20.550
Have you recruited all the people we need?

26:21.980 --> 26:24.710
The handymen and chefs are fully recruited.

26:25.000 --> 26:28.080
We've hired seven head dealers. We still need some more.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.856
I'll meet with the musicians tomorrow.

26:30.880 --> 26:32.890
I'm sure I can pick some good ones.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.766
I don't know how long I'd have to work

26:34.790 --> 26:36.206
on these complicated matters

26:36.230 --> 26:38.160
without you, Manager Ke.

26:42.510 --> 26:44.750
I'm really tired.

26:45.330 --> 26:47.580
If there's nothing else you need me for, Mr. Yun,

26:47.610 --> 26:49.870
can I go back to my room to rest?

26:50.750 --> 26:52.200
Sure.

27:08.600 --> 27:09.776
As you expected,

27:09.800 --> 27:11.236
Tang Xiao went to Shengxingyuan

27:11.260 --> 27:12.766
and stayed there for two hours.

27:12.790 --> 27:14.006
Did you alert him?

27:14.030 --> 27:15.456
I didn't follow him in there.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.996
So I don't know what he did.

27:17.020 --> 27:18.920
Sometimes,

27:19.430 --> 27:22.530
you don't have to hear or see with your own ears and eyes.

27:24.210 --> 27:26.420
Menglan is not a betrayer.

27:26.470 --> 27:27.866
After Godfather got in trouble,

27:27.890 --> 27:29.626
she managed Liansheng House all by herself.

27:29.650 --> 27:31.590
I never saw her being selfish.

27:33.470 --> 27:34.686
Why did I ask you

27:34.710 --> 27:36.760
to inquire about her whereabouts today?

27:37.210 --> 27:38.836
Qian Rong sent a secret letter,

27:38.860 --> 27:40.466
saying someone took away Menglan's elevation certificate

27:40.490 --> 27:42.830
from the Music Office.

27:43.830 --> 27:45.280
That's right.

27:45.720 --> 27:48.510
Who do you think did it?

27:52.250 --> 27:53.636
Yun Xiang.

27:53.660 --> 27:55.596
No matter what Tang Xiao said to Menglan,

27:55.620 --> 27:57.240
I don't think she'll do anything bad.

28:00.350 --> 28:02.150
How about I talk to her,

28:02.400 --> 28:04.090
or let Su Mingyu talk to her?

28:07.340 --> 28:08.790
Let me ask you this.

28:10.350 --> 28:12.566
If you're in the dark right now,

28:12.590 --> 28:14.890
what would you want the most?

28:17.510 --> 28:18.960
To see light.

28:19.820 --> 28:21.270
That's right.

28:21.820 --> 28:23.270
To see light.

28:23.980 --> 28:26.080
Perhaps for Ke Menglan,

28:27.430 --> 28:29.190
it's her lifelong wish

28:29.570 --> 28:31.440
to be elevated out of lowly status.

28:31.830 --> 28:33.880
It might be the light in her heart.

28:35.030 --> 28:38.510
Now this opportunity is right in front of her.

28:39.820 --> 28:43.086
So if she chose to side with Tang Xiao,

28:43.110 --> 28:44.560
I wouldn't blame her.

28:47.940 --> 28:49.620
But have you thought about it?

28:50.030 --> 28:51.920
Once you make it clear,

28:52.380 --> 28:53.756
it's like forcing her to

28:53.780 --> 28:56.560
make a choice between friendship and freedom.

28:56.830 --> 28:58.510
How cruel is that?

29:06.550 --> 29:11.190
If we don't make it clear, we can make use of her

29:11.770 --> 29:15.130
to deliver wrong news to Tang Xiao.

29:15.820 --> 29:17.660
You want to use the same trick again?

29:21.170 --> 29:22.966
If Menglan decided to help Tang Xiao,

29:22.990 --> 29:25.370
how could she and Su Mingyu keep their relationship?

29:26.140 --> 29:27.566
Have you ever thought

29:27.590 --> 29:29.136
why Qian Rong gave the secret letter

29:29.160 --> 29:30.746
to me first,

29:30.770 --> 29:32.760
instead of asking Mingyu directly?

29:33.060 --> 29:34.716
Think about it.

29:34.740 --> 29:37.310
What would Su Mingyu do if he knew about this, given his temper?

29:37.550 --> 29:39.476
If he forces Miss Menglan to make a choice,

29:39.500 --> 29:41.380
what will Miss Menglan do?

29:42.390 --> 29:43.840
Is it really the best choice

29:43.870 --> 29:45.850
to tell Su Mingyu?

29:49.910 --> 29:51.706
Did Tang Xiao

29:51.730 --> 29:53.890
just force us into a dead end like this?

29:54.550 --> 29:56.000
Of course not.

29:58.610 --> 30:00.760
As long as I win this bet,

30:01.500 --> 30:05.500
everything will be solved.

30:08.950 --> 30:10.430
And I want to tell you that

30:11.150 --> 30:12.600
I'll definitely win

30:13.090 --> 30:14.570
this bet.

30:24.260 --> 30:26.910
How much Drunken Dragon Powder did you use?

30:27.450 --> 30:28.466
I used all that I brought.

30:28.490 --> 30:30.570
How prodigal!

30:31.270 --> 30:32.590
If you changed it to taels,

30:32.590 --> 30:34.140
they could've smashed him to death.

30:39.450 --> 30:40.900
Stop pretending.

30:41.160 --> 30:43.216
The antidote should take effect immediately.

30:43.240 --> 30:44.690
Get up.

30:53.390 --> 30:54.840
Tell me.

30:55.440 --> 30:56.906
What's Yun Xiang's plan?

30:56.930 --> 30:58.490
Tell me all about it.

30:58.610 --> 31:00.306
Yun Xiang is the one who wants to beat you.

31:00.330 --> 31:01.870
Go get him.

31:02.210 --> 31:03.236
What are you arresting me for?

31:03.260 --> 31:04.456
Ten Taels of Gold.

31:04.480 --> 31:06.090
I think

31:06.970 --> 31:08.570
you are a sensible person.

31:09.190 --> 31:10.526
So,

31:10.550 --> 31:13.110
let's get straight to the point.

31:13.640 --> 31:15.090
Have some of this.

31:17.430 --> 31:21.346
You should have heard about me.

31:21.370 --> 31:23.016
I'm a businessman.

31:23.040 --> 31:25.036
I want to treat everyone equally.

31:25.060 --> 31:27.430
So those who fall into my hands

31:27.720 --> 31:29.366
won't end well.

31:29.390 --> 31:30.896
You know that too.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.500
So...

31:40.390 --> 31:43.626
So, if you want to die a decent death,

31:43.650 --> 31:44.566
let's make it quick.

31:44.590 --> 31:46.040
Fine.

31:47.470 --> 31:49.270
Is Qi Tianfeng at your place?

31:49.830 --> 31:50.906
I don't know.

31:50.930 --> 31:52.170
You don't know anything, right?

31:52.190 --> 31:54.666
You're the man Yun Xiang trusts the most.

31:54.690 --> 31:56.170
I'm flattered.

31:56.750 --> 31:58.990
The men he trusts the most are Shu Yanan

31:59.020 --> 32:00.660
and Su Mingyu.

32:01.020 --> 32:03.600
I'm just a swordsman who goes by paycheck.

32:05.470 --> 32:06.506
How much does he pay you,

32:06.530 --> 32:08.116
killing people for him?

32:08.140 --> 32:09.956
Ten taels for each person, for real?

32:09.980 --> 32:11.430
Of course.

32:11.460 --> 32:13.846
How about this? Come work for me.

32:13.870 --> 32:15.246
I'll pay you more.

32:15.270 --> 32:16.446
How much?

32:16.470 --> 32:17.920
20 taels.

32:20.250 --> 32:23.730
I won’t do it even if you give me 10000 taels.

32:24.700 --> 32:26.536
Ten Taels of Gold!

32:26.560 --> 32:28.670
If you want to die, I'll grant your wish.

32:28.670 --> 32:31.300
I'll grant your wish.

32:33.140 --> 32:35.180
If I become an evil spirit,

32:37.240 --> 32:38.690
none of you

32:40.080 --> 32:41.640
will make it out alive.

32:58.390 --> 32:59.840
Take him down.

33:08.510 --> 33:11.130
[Lingyuan Sect Ye Xiao]

33:18.500 --> 33:19.950
Mr. Ye.

33:20.790 --> 33:24.350
Recently, the gambling house has cleared another sum of money.

33:24.660 --> 33:26.886
Although the Cao Sect is gone,

33:26.910 --> 33:30.606
I will transfer the money to the north of Yangtze River

33:30.630 --> 33:34.750
at all costs.

33:35.280 --> 33:36.730
It's just that,

33:38.490 --> 33:39.826
according to your order,

33:39.850 --> 33:42.680
I've killed many people from Yuntai Sect.

33:43.030 --> 33:46.390
If I really irritate them,

33:47.220 --> 33:52.990
I'll need Lingyuan Sect's help.

34:00.580 --> 34:03.120
Before the matter of Young Master Xiang is solved,

34:04.160 --> 34:06.070
you don't need to transfer the money anymore.

34:06.850 --> 34:08.755
In case someone follows you

34:08.779 --> 34:10.650
and gets us involved.

34:15.350 --> 34:17.890
You've done a great job all these years.

34:18.390 --> 34:21.510
If you can defeat Yuntai Sect and make another contribution,

34:22.270 --> 34:25.110
I won't mind you become a disciple of our sect.

34:25.230 --> 34:28.080
This way, no matter what trouble you get into,

34:28.580 --> 34:30.906
someone will have your back.

34:30.930 --> 34:35.450
Thank you for your help, Mr. Ye.

34:35.650 --> 34:37.340
Before that,

34:37.790 --> 34:40.390
you'd better keep your identity a secret.

34:41.319 --> 34:43.680
If you dare to tell anyone about Lingyuan Sect,

34:45.260 --> 34:47.100
you'll suffer the consequences yourself.

34:50.350 --> 34:51.800
I understand.

35:01.490 --> 35:04.736
Since we don't miss each other every day, we miss each other now.

35:04.760 --> 35:06.290
That's why I miss you.

35:06.890 --> 35:08.756
I got to know that my Menglan was promoted to manager.

35:08.780 --> 35:10.460
I was more than happy to hear that.

35:10.910 --> 35:12.546
But I also saw you working hard all day,

35:12.570 --> 35:14.020
so I didn't dare to disturb you.

35:15.200 --> 35:17.276
I could only prepare a few dishes

35:17.300 --> 35:18.750
to express my love for you.

35:20.980 --> 35:22.780
It's my fault for being stupid

35:23.180 --> 35:25.680
and making my beloved suffer alone.

35:26.240 --> 35:26.910
From now on,

35:26.910 --> 35:29.610
I'll be with Menglan forever.

35:30.270 --> 35:31.860
A heart for a heart.

35:33.410 --> 35:39.120
[Mingyu]

39:11.260 --> 39:16.230
[No regret once the move is made]
